					"content": "还以为会更特别一点呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110420716
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 110420716,
					"content": "我觉得比起特别，还是平凡一点好。「特别」…其实也不尽如人意。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110420717
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
